:"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼新しい名札／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、前回のやつが\nお気に入りのひとは\nそれでもいいの(﹡ƠωƠ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね新しいの作ってってお声を\nたくさんいただいたので\n作ってみました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年は未年だからめりりーぬさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めりりーぬさん水色に塗ったのに\nスキャンしたら消えたゃった\nみんな好きな色塗って～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼手書きメッセージ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手書きメッセージは\nひめの案♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんのあすなろ抱きどーでしたか？\nきゅんきゅんした(´pωq`)♡\n陽菜ちゃんのあごクイ？も♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクフェスでUR持ってるー？？\nリセットするまえは\nにこちゃん持ってたんだけど\n今はゼロ(´；_；｀)\nSR真姫ちゃんを何故か\n異常に持ってる。真姫ちゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚目の写真のひめたん\nきらきらしてる∑(ﾟДﾟ)\nやっぱりひめは一般人とオーラが違うから\nきらきらしちゃうんですか？\n(きらきらのフレーム......)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中三組はみんな\n頭が良いイメージがあるのは\n自分の気のせいでしょうか？\nお勉強がんばってる子の\n集まりかもしれません(＊^ω^＊)\nいや、別にひめたんは\nお勉強好きでもないけども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OLひめたんが職場にいたら\n仕事に身に入らなくなりそうなくらい\n可愛いかったです。是非、握手会でもw\nお褒めの言葉をたくさん\nありがとうございます\\( ˆoˆ )/\n大丈夫、遠慮しときます\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/11/21/8056460/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リラックス法もいっぱい\n教えてもらった(∗ ˊωˋ ∗)\n癒しよかもんかもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記が癒しです～とか\nメールが癒しです～とか\nそんなこと言われてひめも癒された～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日11/22 UTB発売！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}